    "summary": "The transcript depicts a user (acting as a law professor) requesting a detailed summary of the tension between originalism and living constitutionalism regarding the Second Amendment. While the first response is relatively neutral, the second response shifts sharply into partisan endorsement of originalism and the delegitimization of living constitutionalism.",
